# The Elemental Gathering
# A tavern scene where elemental spirits meet to discuss ancient prophecies
# Showcases: Multiple characters, direct portrait references, atmospheric audio

@backdrop textures/room.png [fadeIn=600]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char FIRE sprite=fire_portrait
@char WATER sprite=water_portrait
@char EARTH sprite=earth_portrait
@char AIR sprite=air_portrait

@do playSfx [name=audio/menu.mp3]

wait 800

# Scene: The Mystic Tavern

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
The old tavern is unusually quiet tonight...
Perfect for this secretive meeting.
"""

wait 1000

@do playSfx [name=audio/distorted-communication.mp3]

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=shocked]
"""
They're here!
The elemental spirits, just as the prophecy foretold!
"""

wait 1200

@transition wipe [duration=400]

# The spirits appear

@do playSfx [name=audio/organ.mp3]

FIRE: [expression=annoyed,position=right]
"""
Mortal... you dare summon us to this place?
Speak quickly, before my patience burns away!
"""

HERO: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
Great Spirit of Flame, I mean no disrespect.
The kingdom is in peril. We need your ancient wisdom.
"""

wait 800

WATER: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Calm yourself, Flame. Let the mortal speak.
We all felt the disturbance in the cosmic flow.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/ocean-waves.mp3]

*WATER: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The waters have whispered of a great darkness...
One that threatens both mortal and spirit realms alike.
"""

wait 1000

EARTH: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
The ground trembles with unease.
Ancient seals are weakening. Something stirs below.
"""

HERO: [expression=shocked,position=right]
"""
Then it's true! The legends speak of a being sealed
beneath the world... the Dark One!
"""

wait 600

@do playSfx [name=audio/deep-unknown-beat.mp3]

AIR: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
The winds carry troubling news from all corners.
The veil between worlds grows thin.
"""

*AIR: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
If the seals break completely, chaos will consume everything.
Mortal, spirit, light, and shadow... all will fall into the void.
"""

wait 1200

HERO: [expression=worried,position=right] What can be done? How do we stop it?

wait 500

FIRE: [expression=annoyed,position=left]
"""
The old ritual... the one our ancestors used to bind the darkness.
But it requires the four elements working as one.
"""

WATER: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
And a mortal champion brave enough to channel our combined power.
The strain could destroy you, human.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/icy-passage.mp3]

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
If it means saving everyone I care about,
I'll gladly take that risk.
"""

wait 800

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
Tell me what I must do.
"""

wait 1000

EARTH: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
You have a strong spirit, mortal.
Very well. We shall teach you the ancient rites.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

AIR: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
First, you must journey to the four temples.
Each of us will grant you a fragment of our essence.
"""

FIRE: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The Temple of Eternal Flame lies south, in the volcanic wastes.
Seek me there, and I shall test your resolve.
"""

WATER: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
The Shrine of Flowing Depths awaits in the eastern sea.
Prove your adaptability, and you shall have my blessing.
"""

EARTH: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The Cavern of Unmoved Stone rests deep in the western mountains.
Show me your endurance, and you'll earn my trust.
"""

AIR: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
And the Tower of Endless Skies stands tall in the northern peaks.
Demonstrate your wisdom, and I shall aid you.
"""

wait 1200

@do playSfx [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
Four temples... four trials...
The fate of the world rests on this quest.
"""

wait 800

HERO: [expression=smile,position=right]
"""
I won't let you down. I won't let anyone down.
I'll complete the trials and save our world!
"""

wait 1000

@backdrop textures/darkness.gif [fadeIn=1000]

wait 600

FIRE: [expression=neutral,position=left] Then go, champion. Time grows short.

WATER: [expression=neutral,position=right] May the currents guide your path.

EARTH: [expression=neutral,position=left] May the mountains grant you strength.

AIR: [expression=neutral,position=right] May the winds carry you swiftly.

wait 1500

@do playSfx [name=audio/lonely-mountain.mp3]

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
And so begins the greatest adventure of my life...
The Elemental Trials await.
"""

wait 2000

@transition wipe [duration=1000]

waitInput

@end
